{"id":"c4be32bd9eb1caa01008021ae82a630f","note_id":"game-macro","at":"2026-11-09T14:08:45.521347+00:00","origin":"manual","body_sha256":"d846f232dabec09bbf6de0eb93279da2af31447e5b8daf9a9ea902a907eeddd6","review_refs":[],"record":{"body":{"schema_version":6,"leading":"","nodes":[{"id":"g-1c9d03415a033a9c38cf","type":"heading","level":1,"title":"游戏大局观","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"type":"entry","id":"n-0eb1de62a6360866bf1b","key":"名次目标与阶段安排","show_key":true,"value":"回合投入应服务于当前名次目标。前期评估可承担的掉血和成长启动时间，中期检查成型条件能否按期满足，后期根据仍在场的主要对手决定维持当前阵容或调整针对手段。具体判断见[游戏决策逻辑](api/notes/game-decisions/reading)。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-22a2f53d939fc1fe05a1","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"前期目标","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-05cde3faa0c2e9313e3d","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"中期发展","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-2129555de1f4d5070b83","type":"entry","key":"前两轮拍卖补核心","show_key":true,"value":"计划通过拍卖补齐核心英雄，应重视前两次拍卖。第二次拍卖结束后仍缺核心英雄时，可改用商店刷新寻找核心英雄。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-17a2ab40ff5c77d80979","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"后期收束","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-a8ef5ed5dcd49c4fe4be","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"夺冠与保名次","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-6b80fd27bccb0e803962","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"转型与投入","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-d68ac9bbb4de17aabcb2","type":"entry","key":"转型前保留等级转移手段","show_key":true,"value":"准备转阵容、且场上已有不适合新阵容的高等级英雄时，提前确认可用的等级转移效果牌，避免换人时丢掉前期积累。具体接收目标和适用范围要按效果牌分别判断。","separator":"\n\n"}],"supporting_nodes":[],"semantics":{}},"metadata":{"id":"game-macro","type":"other","title":"游戏大局观","path":"knowledge/other/游戏大局观.json","aliases":[],"entities":[],"related":[],"claim_annotations":[{"id":"g-5ead5028eafa17609fdb","text_ref":"g-2129555de1f4d5070b83","section":"中期发展","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-43e5dddcdc3fba2a1fe7fbf9784309d4cbe586ff232964e52284b194c2974c1c","paragraph_start":11,"paragraph_end":12}],"c